    {
      "name": "2. Documents",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Crear borrador de Factura",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) { pm.collectionVariables.set('invoiceDocumentId', body.id); }",
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.code === 201);",
                  "pm.test('status draft (todavía no se reclamó número)', () => body.status === 'draft');",
                  "pm.test('sin número ni CUFE todavía', () => !body.number && !body.document_key);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Crea un BORRADOR — valida y persiste customer/lines, pero NO reclama número, NO firma, NO envía (eso solo pasa en 'POST Confirmar documento', más abajo). Se puede editar (PUT) o eliminar (DELETE) libremente mientras siga en borrador. customer_id es opcional — solo trazabilidad a un cliente guardado (ver carpeta '3. Customers'), nunca reemplaza 'customer'. Si {{customerId}} está vacío, se manda como cadena vacía y la API lo trata como 'no se mandó' (sin error).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"numbering_range_id\": \"{{invoiceRangeId}}\",\n  \"customer_id\": \"{{customerId}}\",\n  \"customer\": {\n    \"identification\": { \"number\": \"222222222222\", \"type_code\": \"13\" },\n    \"name\": \"Consumidor Final\"\n  },\n  \"lines\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Servicio de prueba (Postman)\",\n      \"quantity\": 1,\n      \"unit_code\": \"94\",\n      \"line_extension_cents\": 10000,\n      \"unit_price_cents\": 10000,\n      \"taxes\": [\n        { \"taxable_amount_cents\": 10000, \"tax_amount_cents\": 0, \"percent\": 0, \"type_code\": \"01\", \"type_name\": \"IVA\" }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "invoices"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT Editar borrador de Factura",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Reemplaza por completo los datos de un borrador — solo mientras siga en borrador (409 si ya se confirmó). Aquí solo se corrige la descripción de la línea, a modo de ejemplo.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"numbering_range_id\": \"{{invoiceRangeId}}\",\n  \"customer\": {\n    \"identification\": { \"number\": \"222222222222\", \"type_code\": \"13\" },\n    \"name\": \"Consumidor Final\"\n  },\n  \"lines\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Servicio de prueba (Postman, corregido)\",\n      \"quantity\": 1,\n      \"unit_code\": \"94\",\n      \"line_extension_cents\": 10000,\n      \"unit_price_cents\": 10000,\n      \"taxes\": [\n        { \"taxable_amount_cents\": 10000, \"tax_amount_cents\": 0, \"percent\": 0, \"type_code\": \"01\", \"type_name\": \"IVA\" }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceDocumentId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "invoices",
                "{{invoiceDocumentId}}"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Confirmar documento (Factura)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('invoicePrefix', body.prefix);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('invoiceCufe', body.document_key);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
                  "pm.test('ya tiene número y CUFE', () => !!body.number && !!body.document_key);",
                  "pm.test('XML firmado (contiene ds:Signature)', () => body.signed_xml.includes('<ds:Signature'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
